## 13. Dependency injection misconfiguration

**Risk:** Wrong implementation registered; circular DI at runtime.

**Fix:** composition root validates graph; prefer constructor injection and explicit wiring.

```ts
// composition.ts
const uow = new PrismaUnitOfWork(prisma);
const orderRepo = new PrismaOrderRepository(prisma);
const invPort = new InventoryAdapter(httpClient);

const checkoutService = new CheckoutService(uow, orderRepo, new PrismaInventoryRepository(prisma));
// register in container only after manual wiring check
```

