[AlertDisplay] OK: 22°C
[StatsDisplay] avg=22.0°C over 1 readings
[ConsoleDisplay] Temperature is now 35°C
[AlertDisplay] ⚠ HIGH TEMP: 35°C (threshold 30°C)
[StatsDisplay] avg=28.5°C over 2 readings
[AlertDisplay] OK: 18°C
[StatsDisplay] avg=25.0°C over 3 readings
```

