### Usage Example

```typescript
const ps = new PrefixSum([2, 4, 6, 8]);

console.log(ps.rangeSum(0, 2)); // 2+4+6 = 12
console.log(ps.rangeSum(1, 3)); // 4+6+8 = 18
console.log(ps.total());        // 20
```

